{"synopsis":"\\[Dari studio yang mengerjakan Solo Leveling bersama Redice Studio! Dan juga Martial God Regressed to Level 2]\n\nPutra bungsu dari Grup Dagang Eunhae, Eun Seoho, terlahir dengan bakat dalam bidang bisnis..\n\n\"Bagaimana mungkin Aliansi Murim melakukan ini padaku...?\"\n\"Para petinggi Aliansi menganggapmu sebagai gangguan. Cih, semua ini hanya demi uang.\"\n\nIa dibunuh oleh Aliansi Murim dan kembali ke masa ketika ia masih belajar seluk-beluk Grup Dagang Eunhae. Kini, Seoho bertekad untuk menjalani kehidupan keduanya tanpa penyesalan.\n\n\"Aku akan menjatuhkan kalian semua dengan hal yang kalian remehkan. UANG!!!\"\n\nMaka dimulailah perjalanan seorang kaisar bisnis yang hebat, Eun Seoho, yang kecerdasan luar biasa dan bakat bela dirinya akan tercatat dalam sejarah!","alternative_title":"은해상단 막내아들","author":"Choi Jeong-Hwan, Hyang-Ran","artist":"Shin Seo-Ram","chapters":[{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"b632a905-9b75-4de6-a6a1-44f0ce3dda12","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-16"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"bac8bf12-e214-4ac0-a293-ba02d092192b","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-16"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"8253c851-d865-42ca-8f59-396212c572b4","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"7670a5ec-ae79-40f2-9033-dc9cd34be7f2","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"0e995dc4-9a14-4ed1-8adf-f82ff3405606","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"1525fa9f-961e-43cc-a3c2-b5abee14e42c","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"9e391877-5b1c-4074-ba1d-bbb57dad8b92","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-05-21"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"959203d9-1162-426e-8b31-2b5d6b362d19","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-05-11"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"78a0db58-2bb9-4902-87b9-5fd6228f0e7d","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-04-30"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":